` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"},"417":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Toggle Chips for selecting multiple peer filters"},"418":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Removable Chips for user-added filters and input tokens"},"419":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Shared `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes, with optional leading icons"},"420":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"},"421":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-add"},"422":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stor"},"423":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './chip.stories.tsx';\n\n<Meta of={Stories} name=\"Overview\""},"424":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#content","content":"Use a string for a simple label. For icons or other composed content, wrap the\nvisible label in `Text` and provide `textValue` for the accessible name. See\n**Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips** above."},"425":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#selection-and-removal","content":"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."},"426":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Set `size` on `ChipGroup` to keep a collection consistent. `ChipList` wraps by\ndefault and accepts layout props for custom arrangements. See **Sizes**."},"427":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."},"428":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use `Label` or `aria-label` to name the `ChipGroup`; this names the collection,\nnot its individual Chips."},"429":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Give each Chip a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`. Use `textValue`\nwhen a Chip contains icons, composed content, or a render prop."},"430":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use