"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1385,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1382,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[691,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[690,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[698,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[699,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[697,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1563,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1136,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[679,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[217,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[683,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1389,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1527,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1561,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1169,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1291,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[942,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[941,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1170,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[232,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[676,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[730,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[228,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[227,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[681,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[230,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1641,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[318,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[754,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[266,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[261,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[263,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[262,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[752,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[265,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[362,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[361,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[738,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[678,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1526,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1313,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1000,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1315,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[909,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[749,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[907,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1004,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1317,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1529,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1562,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1528,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[845,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[215,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[214,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[270,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[737,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[212,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[739,"**DOM Output:**"],[684,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1557,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[755,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[743,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[728,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[677,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1320,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[731,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[229,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[241,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[244,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[233,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[844,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[835,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[706,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[746,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[213,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[367,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[366,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[236,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[908,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1640,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[269,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[742,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[231,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[759,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[235,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1530,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[753,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1135,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[675,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[740,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[757,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[750,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1166,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1165,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[910,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1321,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[864,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[741,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[736,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[211,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[242,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1642,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[216,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[240,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[237,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1288,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1289,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1380,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Moda